  "changes": [
    {
      "location": "FileDelete",
      "change": "Restored the earlier catalog error handling without the root-directory special case.",
      "evidence": "At 0x404476, the ROM translates CMNotEmpty to FBsyErr and passes other results to CmdDone. It lacks the January 1987 CMRootCN comparison and ParamErr result. The original history states that this fix was not patched for the Mac Plus."
    },
    {
      "location": "ReName",
      "change": "Removed later volume-name length checks and the directory guard before the FCB update. Restored the original ReName entry label.",
      "evidence": "The ROM calls CMRenameCN directly at 0x404554, after preparing D0 and D2. At 0x4045ba it proceeds from the catalog lookup to the FCB update without checking cdrDirRec. RNmVol1 starts with TST.W D3 at 0x4045f8. The surviving source incorporated these checks and the ReNameTrap naming change in 1992."
    },
    {
      "location": "RNmVol1",
      "change": "Restored the direct VCBDrvNum check and the earlier MFS exit.",
      "evidence": "The ROM tests VCBDrvNum at 0x404608. It lacks the April 1986 volume-signature and ExtOffLinCk sequence. After SetVolName and TFSVCBTst, the BNE at 0x40461a targets RNmExit directly. The January 1986 correction instead targeted RNmExOK to clear D0."
    },
    {
      "location": "Definitions, encoding, and provenance",
      "change": "Copied original equates, supplied external addresses, and made PC-relative JSR operands explicit. Preserved the original header, applicable history, and comments. Marked new comments as reconstruction notes.",
      "evidence": "CmpString and BlockMove emit 0xa03c and 0xa02e. The second branch to MvExOK at 0x404714 uses a word displacement, unlike the surviving short form. All 908 bytes and 26 recorded labels match the ROM."
    }
  ],
